---
// Código de Vestimenta
---

<section id="dresscode" class="py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 relative z-10 bg-transparent">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Encabezado con Caligrafía Dorada -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-[#0E1B33]/5 border border-[#D4AF37]/35 mb-4">
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#0E1B33] font-semibold">Etiqueta &amp; Estilo</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-editorial text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-light text-[#0E1B33] tracking-wide mb-2">
        Código de Vestimenta
      </h2>
      <div class="h-[1px] w-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#D4AF37] to-transparent mx-auto mb-4"></div>
      <p class="font-editorial text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#0E1B33] italic font-light mb-2">
        Formal Elegante
      </p>
      <p class="font-editorial italic text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#5A6A85] max-w-xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed">
        Queremos que te sientas cómodo/a y disfrutes al máximo de esta gran celebración junto a nosotros.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Tarjetas de Guía para Ellas y Ellos con Marcos Dorados -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
      <!-- Tarjeta Mujeres -->
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-white/95 invitation-frame shadow-lg text-center flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-[#FCFBF7] border border-[#D4AF37]/50 flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] mb-5 shadow-xs ring-4 ring-[#D4AF37]/10">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#D4AF37]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M8 3h8l1 6-3 4 5 8H5l5-8-3-4 1-6z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-editorial text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#0E1B33] font-normal mb-2">
          Damas
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#0E1B33] font-semibold mb-4 bg-[#0E1B33]/5 border border-[#D4AF37]/45 px-5 py-2 rounded-full">
          Vestido Formal
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Tarjeta Hombres -->
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-white/95 invitation-frame shadow-lg text-center flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-[#FCFBF7] border border-[#D4AF37]/50 flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] mb-5 shadow-xs ring-4 ring-[#D4AF37]/10">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#D4AF37]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M7 3h10l-2 8-3-3-3 3-2-8z" />
            <path d="M9 14l3 2 3-2v5H9v-5z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-editorial text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#0E1B33] font-normal mb-2">
          Caballeros
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#0E1B33] font-semibold mb-4 bg-[#0E1B33]/5 border border-[#D4AF37]/45 px-5 py-2 rounded-full">
          Traje Formal
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bloque Especial: Colores Reservados Exclusivamente para los Novios -->
    <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-white/95 invitation-frame shadow-lg text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0E1B33]/5 border border-[#D4AF37]/35 text-[#0E1B33] text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-4">
        <span>✦ Colores Reservados para los Novios ✦</span>
      </div>

      <h3 class="font-editorial text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#0E1B33] font-normal mb-2">
        Cualquier color es bienvenido, excepto:
      </h3>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 max-w-lg mx-auto mb-6">
        <!-- Color Reservado 1: Perla / Blanco -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#FCFBF7] border border-[#D4AF37]/35 flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#FAF8F5] border-2 border-[#D4AF37] shadow-inner flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#917238]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="text-left">
            <span class="block text-sm sm:text-base uppercase tracking-[0.15em] font-semibold text-[#0E1B33]">
              Color Perla / Blanco
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#917238] font-medium">
              Reservado para la Novia
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Color Reservado 2: Azul Noche -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#FCFBF7] border border-[#D4AF37]/35 flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#0E1B33] border-2 border-[#D4AF37] shadow-inner flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-white/90" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="text-left">
            <span class="block text-sm sm:text-base uppercase tracking-[0.15em] font-semibold text-[#0E1B33]">
              Azul Noche
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#917238] font-medium">
              Reservado para el Novio
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="font-editorial italic text-base sm:text-lg text-[#5A6A85] max-w-lg mx-auto mb-2 font-light">
        Agradecemos con mucho cariño abstenerse de usar los siguientes dos colores, reservados exclusivamente para los novios:
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
